#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/flashing/openmv-rt1062.rst:58
msgid ""
"The FCB, FAT disk, and ROMFS sizes are fixed in the IDE configuration. The "
"SBL and firmware sizes shown are the region span to the next region's base "
"address (the start addresses are fixed; the actual image is smaller)."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran FCB, disk FAT, dan ROMFS ditetapkan dalam konfigurasi IDE. Ukuran SBL"
" dan firmware yang ditampilkan adalah rentang wilayah ke alamat dasar "
"wilayah berikutnya (alamat awal ditetapkan; citra aktual lebih kecil)."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/flashing/openmv-rt1062.rst:66
msgid ""
"To wipe the camera's internal FAT filesystem -- the fix when a bad "
"``main.py`` or a corrupted filesystem stops the camera from booting -- see "
":doc:`erasing`."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menghapus filesystem FAT internal kamera -- perbaikan saat ``main.py``"
" yang buruk atau filesystem yang rusak menghentikan kamera dari booting -- "
"lihat :doc:`erasing`\\ ."

